{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47209","headline":"酬和友人见寄 · 慕幽","name":"酬和友人见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"劳歌好自看，终久偶齐桓。\n五字若教易，一名争得难。\n侵窓红树老，荫砌雪花残。\n莫効齐僚属，东归翦钓竿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"慕幽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47209.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47209","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}